{"id":"116742","t":{"th":"เกิดใหม่ทั้งทีก็เป็นสไลม์ไปซะแล้ว ภาคที่ 2 Part 2","ro":"Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken 2nd Season Part 2","en":"That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime Season 2 Part 2","na":"転生したらスライムだった件 第2期 第2クール"},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx116742-jn0dW23ftehq.jpg","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx116742-jn0dW23ftehq.jpg","color":"#e4a15d","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/116742-yJjsZw2UppWO.jpg","fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":12,"dur":24,"season":"SUMMER","year":2021,"start":"2021-07-06","country":"JP","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"score":82,"pop":277946,"studio":"8-bit","desc":"The nation of Tempest is in a festive mood after successfully overcoming the surprise attack from the Falmuth Army and the Western Holy Church. Beyond the festivities lies a meeting between Tempest and its allies to decide the future of the Nation of Monsters. The aftermath of the Falmuth invasion, Milim Nava's suspicious behavior, and the disappearance of Demon Lord Carrion—the problems seem to keep on piling up.\n\nRimuru Tempest, now awakened as a \"True Demon Lord,\" decides to go on the offensive against Clayman. With the fully revived \"Storm Dragon\" Veldora, \"Ultimate Skill\" Raphael, and other powerful comrades, the ruler of the Tempest is confident in taking down his enemies one by one until he can face the man pulling the strings.","descTh":"ประเทศ Tempest อยู่ในอารมณ์รื่นเริงหลังจากเอาชนะการโจมตีที่น่าประหลาดใจจากกองทัพ Falmuth และ Western Holy Church ได้สำเร็จ นอกเหนือจากการเฉลิมฉลองแล้ว ยังมีการพบกันระหว่าง Tempest และพันธมิตรเพื่อตัดสินอนาคตของ Nation of Monsters ผลพวงของการรุกรานที่ฟัลมุธ พฤติกรรมที่น่าสงสัยของมิลิม นาวา และการหายตัวไปของจอมมารคาร์ริออน ปัญหาต่างๆ ดูเหมือนจะทวีคูณขึ้นเรื่อยๆ\n\nริมูรุ เทมเปสต์ ซึ่งตอนนี้ตื่นขึ้นมาในฐานะ \"เจ้าอสูรที่แท้จริง\" ตัดสินใจเปิดฉากโจมตีเคลย์แมน ด้วย Veldora \"Storm Dragon\" ที่ฟื้นคืนชีพมาอย่างเต็มที่, \"Ultimate Skill\" Raphael และสหายผู้ทรงพลังอื่นๆ ผู้ปกครองแห่ง Tempest มีความมั่นใจที่จะกำจัดศัตรูทีละคนจนกว่าเขาจะเผชิญหน้ากับชายผู้ดึงเชือกได้","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":"licensor","descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"S4VDmPgxpTs","al":"https://anilist.co/anime/116742","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/41487","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"muse_th","r":"TH","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLIa05JMgYhhb_sMTyhVSqLdhGQY7uGJxZ","lang":"dub","eps":[["1","y:iOo1vwuginw",1667200881,"~",null,"37",{"d":1423,"sk":[[134.4,222.3],[1326.1,1415.0]]}],["2","y:TTMwDSxZ5RU",1667200881,"~",null,"38",{"d":1423,"sk":[[48.4,136.3],[1326.2,1415.0]]}],["3","y:Wy4x1_UvP5Y",1667200881,"~",null,"39",{"d":1423,"sk":[[128.4,216.2],[1326.1,1415.0]]}],["4","y:At8ojJbdgZg",1667200881,"~",null,"40",{"d":1423,"sk":[[103.4,191.3],[1326.1,1414.9]]}],["5","y:O4hLC8kbKw8",1667200881,"~",null,"41",{"d":1423,"sk":[[24.4,112.3],[1325.1,1415.0]]}],["6","y:9hcocBu5pPc",1667200881,"~",null,"42",{"d":1423,"sk":[[87.1,177.3],[1326.2,1415.0]]}],["7","y:gOJHzkPWIw0",1667200881,"~",null,"43",{"d":1423,"sk":[[115.4,203.3],[1326.1,1415.0]]}],["8","y:TmUX3mRtSg8",1667200881,"~",null,"44",{"d":1423,"sk":[[1.4,89.3],[1326.1,1414.9]]}],["9","y:AU0LrjAIFpk",1667200881,"~",null,"45",{"d":1423,"sk":[[278.2,368.3]]}],["10","y:3A2BtovH7Y0",1667200881,"~",null,"46",{"d":1423,"sk":[[1326.1,1415.0]]}],["11","y:k5lpbj-cqsk",1667200881,"~",null,"47",{"d":1423,"sk":[[1.4,89.3]]}],["12","y:BDnsjGfPrx0",1667200881,"~",null,"48",{"d":1418,"sk":[[1274.5,1321.5]],"fin":1}]]},{"p":"muse_th","r":"TH","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLIa05JMgYhhYgIJU24-HhP3UwM3MA93rR","lang":"sub","eps":[["1","y:uV4MRkxOIpg",1667200881,"~",null,"37",{"d":1423,"sk":[[134.4,222.3],[1326.1,1415.0]]}],["2","y:j9oI9bkPu3Q",1667200881,"~",null,"38",{"d":1423,"sk":[[48.4,136.3],[1326.2,1415.0]]}],["3","y:_Ew50x5BM-U",1667200881,"~",null,"39",{"d":1423,"sk":[[128.4,216.2],[1326.1,1415.0]]}],["4","